OL,3,AFamed ship SS United States to be sunk
OL,4,Aoff coast of Florida
OL,5,
OL,6,FInstead, after being purchased by a
OL,7,FFlorida county, it will be added to the
OL,8,Fdozens of artificial reefs off the
OL,9,Fcoast, as a land-based museum detailing
OL,10,Fthe ship's history is also planned.
